{"id":131,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Crossing icy seas is no issue for this cold-resistant Pokémon. Its smooth skin is a little cool to the touch."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"A smart and kindhearted Pokémon, it glides across the surface of the sea while its beautiful song echoes around it."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!"],"text":"A gentle soul that can understand human speech. It can ferry people across the sea on its back."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"They’ve been so cherished that there’s now an overabundance. The fish Pokémon population has declined in waters with too many Lapras."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It likes swimming around with people on its back. In the Alola region, it’s an important means of transportation over water."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"These Pokémon were once near extinction due to poaching. Following protective regulations, there is now an overabundance of them."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Its high intelligence enables it to comprehend human speech. When it’s in a good mood, it sings in its beautiful voice."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"People have driven Lapras almost to the point of extinction. In the evenings, this Pokémon is said to sing plaintively as it seeks what few others of its kind still remain."},{"games":["Y","FireRed"],"text":"Its high intelligence enables it to understand human speech. It likes to ferry people on its back."},{"games":["X","HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"They have gentle hearts. Because they rarely fight, many have been caught. Their number has dwindled."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Able to understand human speech and very intelligent, it loves to swim in the sea with people on its back."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It loves crossing the sea with people and Pokémon on its back. It understands human speech."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"It ferries people across the sea on its back. It may sing an enchanting cry if it is in a good mood."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"A POKéMON that has been overhunted almost to extinction. It can ferry people on its back."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Water Absorb","hidden":false,"description":"If hit by a Water-type move, the Pokémon has its HP restored instead of taking damage."},{"name":"Shell Armor","hidden":false,"description":"A hard shell protects the Pokémon from critical hits."},{"name":"Hydration","hidden":true,"description":"Cures the Pokémon's status conditions in rain."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Water 1"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":40,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"sea","color":"Blue","shape":"Fish","evolution":{"id":131,"name":"Lapras","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,45],[1,55],[5,47],[10,54],[15,791],[20,420],[25,109],[30,352],[35,362],[40,34],[45,58],[50,240],[55,56],[60,195],[65,329]],"machine":[914,419,59,776,34,523,204,886,109,174,574,38,913,349,406,529,89,203,263,416,114,270,56,63,304,58,333,196,442,710,330,200,182,94,917,240,115,156,214,684,883,164,57,36,851,87,85,352,127,311,250,428],"egg":[246,174,90,573,32,664,321],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me55-131","name":"Lapras","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"131","artist":"Amelicart","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-131/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-131/large"},{"id":"me55-17","name":"Lapras","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Common","number":"17","artist":"Masa","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-17/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-17/large"},{"id":"me3-22","name":"Lapras ex","set":"Perfect Order","date":"2026-03-27","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"22","artist":null,"small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me3-22/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me3-22/large"},{"id":"sv10-50","name":"Misty's Lapras","s